<section id="sizing" class="about-sizing-section page-container pt-24" style="padding-top: 6rem;">
  <div class="about-sizing-grid grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10" style="display: grid; gap: 2.5rem;">
    <div class="reveal sizing-heading-col lg:col-span-4">
      <p class="eyebrow text-mute" style="color: var(--color-mute);">Sizing &amp; fit</p>
      <h2 class="display text-4xl sm:text-5xl mt-4" style="font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 3.25rem); margin-top: 1rem;">
        Relaxed by <span class="serif-accent text-navy" style="color: var(--color-navy);">design.</span>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal sizing-cards-col lg:col-span-7 lg:col-start-6 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; --reveal-delay: 100ms;">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-paper p-6" style="border-radius: 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--color-line); background: var(--color-paper); padding: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 class="font-semibold tracking-tight" style="font-weight: 600;">Relaxed fit</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft" style="margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-ink-soft);">
          Our hoodies and tees are cut relaxed with an oversized-inspired silhouette. For a more fitted look, consider sizing down.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-paper p-6" style="border-radius: 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--color-line); background: var(--color-paper); padding: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 class="font-semibold tracking-tight" style="font-weight: 600;">Unisex sizing</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft" style="margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-ink-soft);">
          Every piece is unisex, available from S up to 2XL or 3XL depending on the style. Full garment measurements are listed on each product page.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-paper p-6" style="border-radius: 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--color-line); background: var(--color-paper); padding: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 class="font-semibold tracking-tight" style="font-weight: 600;">Heavyweight feel</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft" style="margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-ink-soft);">
          The Heavyweight Hoodie is built with a premium, substantial hand-feel &mdash; perfect for layering or on its own.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-paper p-6" style="border-radius: 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--color-line); background: var(--color-paper); padding: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 class="font-semibold tracking-tight" style="font-weight: 600;">Care</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft" style="margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-ink-soft);">
          Machine wash cold on a gentle cycle, tumble dry low, and avoid ironing directly on the print to keep every piece looking its best.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .about-sizing-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr)) !important;
    }
    .sizing-heading-col {
      grid-column: span 4 / span 4 !important;
    }
    .sizing-cards-col {
      grid-column: 6 / span 7 !important;
    }
  }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "About Sizing & Fit",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
